-- The five documents are named, not tested; the one operative sentence is in 1.1: a
-- requester who did not sign the request form but has paid premium is taken to agree with
-- the information on the contract the insurer issued.
DECLARE `A document making up the contract` IS ONE OF
    `1.1 the request form`
    `1.2 these Rules`
    `1.3 the certificate or policy schedule`
    `1.4 other written agreements, if any`
    `1.5 written amendments and additions, if any`

@ref Rules, Article 1.1-1.5 (src 103-115)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A document making up the contract`
`Article 1 — the documents that make up the contract` MEANS
    LIST `1.1 the request form`, `1.2 these Rules`, `1.3 the certificate or policy schedule`, `1.4 other written agreements, if any`, `1.5 written amendments and additions, if any`

@ref Rules, Article 1.1 (src 103-108)
GIVEN `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1.1 — the requester is taken to agree with the information on the contract issued` `the policy` MEANS
        NOT `the request counts as signed under definition 6` `the policy`
    AND `the policy`'s `the premium arrangements`'s `the premium paid so far` GREATER THAN 0

§§ `Counting days`

-- The day N days after a date (the date itself not counted: fork F7).
GIVEN `the number of days` IS A NUMBER
      `the date`           IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the day` `the number of days` `days after` `the date` MEANS
    Date (Day `the date` PLUS `the number of days`)

-- The share of the period of insurance left from a date (the date itself included, since a
-- contract that ends "on" a date is not in effect that day: fork F13), counted in calendar
-- days with both the first and the last day of the period inside it (forks F8, F9).
-- 0 for a date after the end; 1 for a date at or before the start.
GIVEN `the date`   IS A DATE
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the share of the period of insurance remaining from` `the date` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    max 0 (min 1 ((Day `the end` MINUS Day `the date` PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY (Day `the end` MINUS Day `the start` PLUS 1)))
    WHERE
        `the start` MEANS `the policy`'s `the start of the period of insurance`
        `the end`   MEANS `the policy`'s `the end of the period of insurance`

§§ `Article 2 — The period of insurance and payment of the premium`

-- src:117 | Điều 2. Thời hạn bảo hiểm và quy định về thanh toán Phí bảo hiểm
-- src:118 | 2.1 Thời hạn bảo hiểm bắt đầu và kết thúc được ghi trên Giấy chứng nhận bảo
-- src:119 | hiểm/Đơn bảo hiểm (sau đây gọi tắt là “Thời hạn bảo hiểm”).
-- The period is whatever the certificate states; both its first and its last day are taken
-- to be inside it (fork F8).
@ref Rules, Article 2.1 (src 118-119)
GIVEN `the date`   IS A DATE
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`2.1 — within the period of insurance` `the date` `under` `the policy` MEANS
        `the date` AT LEAST `the policy`'s `the start of the period of insurance`
    AND `the date` AT MOST  `the policy`'s `the end of the period of insurance`

GIVEN `the date`           IS A DATE
      `the arrangements`   IS A `The premium arrangements`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the premium was paid in full on or before` `the date` `under` `the arrangements` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the arrangements`'s `the date the premium was paid in full`
    WHEN NOTHING          THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `paid on`   THEN `paid on` AT MOST `the date`

-- src:120 | 2.2 Hợp đồng bảo hiểm chỉ có hiệu lực với điều kiện là Bên mua bảo hiểm đã thanh
-- src:121 | toán đầy đủ Phí bảo hiểm, trừ trường hợp BẢO VIỆT có thỏa thuận khác bằng văn
-- src:122 | bản với Bên mua bảo hiểm về thời hạn thanh toán Phí bảo hiểm.
-- The contract has effect only if the premium has been paid in full, unless the insurer has
-- agreed IN WRITING a time for payment. An agreement allowing the purchaser to owe the
-- premium (3.1.1) is read as such an agreement (fork F10).
@ref Rules, Article 2.2 (src 120-122)
GIVEN `the date`         IS A DATE
      `the arrangements` IS A `The premium arrangements`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`2.2 — the premium condition is met on` `the date` `under` `the arrangements` MEANS
        `the premium was paid in full on or before` `the date` `under` `the arrangements`
    OR  `the arrangements`'s `a written agreement on the time for paying the premium`
    OR  `the arrangements`'s `an agreement allowing the purchaser to owe the premium`

-- src:123 | 2.3 Trường hợp Bên mua bảo hiểm không thanh toán đầy đủ Phí bảo hiểm và không có
-- src:124 | bất kỳ thỏa thuận về thời hạn thanh toán Phí bảo hiểm quy định tại Khoản 2.2 của
-- src:125 | Điều này thì Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ tự động chấm dứt hiệu lực.
-- src:130 | Điều 3. Chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:131 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm chấm dứt trong các trường hợp sau đây:
-- src:132 | 3.1 Chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo hiểm vì vi phạm thời hạn thanh toán theo Khoản 2.3 của
-- src:133 | Điều 2 Quy tắc bảo hiểm này:
-- src:137 | 3.1.1 Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ chấm dứt hiệu lực vào ngày kế tiếp ngày Bên mua bảo
-- src:138 | hiểm phải thanh toán Phí bảo hiểm theo quy định đã thỏa thuận tại Hợp đồng
-- src:139 | giao kết ban đầu nhưng Bên mua bảo hiểm không thanh toán đầy đủ Phí bảo
-- src:140 | hiểm và BẢO VIỆT không có thỏa thuận cho Bên mua bảo hiểm nợ phí theo
-- src:141 | quy định pháp luật.
-- 2.3 says the contract ends of itself where the premium is unpaid and no time was agreed;
-- 3.1, which says it applies to 2.3, puts the end on the day after the date the premium was
-- due under the contract as first concluded, unless it was paid in full by then or the
-- insurer agreed to let it be owed. 3.1.1 speaks of an AGREED date and 2.3 of the case with
-- NO agreement; the encoding reads the date by which the premium was to be paid as whatever
-- the contract fixed, agreed deferral or not (finding X9).
-- NOTHING: the contract does not end for non-payment.
@ref Rules, Articles 2.3 (src 123-125) and 3.1.1 (src 137-141)
GIVEN `the arrangements` IS A `The premium arrangements`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`3.1.1 — the date the contract ends for non-payment under` `the arrangements` MEANS
    IF      `the premium was paid in full on or before` (`the arrangements`'s `the date by which the premium was to be paid`) `under` `the arrangements`
         OR `the arrangements`'s `an agreement allowing the purchaser to owe the premium`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (`the day` 1 `days after` (`the arrangements`'s `the date by which the premium was to be paid`))

-- src:149 | 3.1.3 Hợp đồng bảo hiểm tiếp tục có hiệu lực khi Bên mua bảo hiểm thanh toán đủ
-- src:150 | phí bảo hiểm và phải được BẢO VIỆT chấp thuận bằng văn bản. Thời điểm
-- src:151 | Hợp đồng tiếp tục có hiệu lực được quy định trên văn bản chấp thuận.
-- After an end for non-payment the contract continues once the premium is paid in full and
-- the insurer accepts in writing, from the date the acceptance states.
@ref Rules, Article 3.1.3 (src 149-151)
GIVEN `the date`         IS A DATE
      `the arrangements` IS A `The premium arrangements`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`3.1.3 — the contract has been continued by the date` `the date` `under` `the arrangements` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the arrangements`'s `the date a written acceptance continues the contract from`
    WHEN NOTHING        THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `from`    THEN `from` AT MOST `the date`

-- src:126 | 2.4 Trong Thời hạn bảo hiểm, trường hợp có sự chuyển quyền sở hữu xe được bảo
-- src:127 | hiểm, Hợp đồng bảo hiểm mặc nhiên có hiệu lực đối với chủ xe mới và chấm dứt
-- src:128 | hiệu lực với chủ xe cũ, trừ trường hợp chủ xe cũ yêu cầu chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:129 | hiểm.
-- On a transfer of ownership in the period the contract runs on for the new owner and ends
-- for the former one, unless the former owner asks for it to end. The Rules do not say when
-- a contract ended at that request ends; taken as the date of transfer (fork F12).

§§ `Article 3 — The end of the contract`

-- src:130 | Điều 3. Chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:131 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm chấm dứt trong các trường hợp sau đây:

-- src:153 | 3.2.1 Trong thời hạn bảo hiểm, một trong hai bên có quyền đơn phương chấm dứt
-- src:154 | thực hiện Hợp đồng bảo hiểm theo quy định pháp luật bằng cách thông báo
-- src:155 | bằng văn bản cho bên kia, trong đó xác định rõ thời điểm chấm dứt của Hợp
-- src:156 | đồng bảo hiểm. Nếu văn bản thông báo không xác định rõ thời điểm chấm dứt
-- src:157 | của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm thì Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ chấm dứt vào ngày của văn
-- src:158 | bản thông báo đó.
-- Either party may end the contract by written notice stating when it ends; a notice that
-- states no time ends it on the date of the notice. "Ends on day X" is read as: not in
-- effect on day X, the same reading 3.1.1's "the day after" requires (fork F13).
@ref Rules, Article 3.2.1 (src 153-158)
GIVEN `the notice` IS A `A notice of unilateral termination`
GIVETH A DATE
`3.2.1 — the date the contract ends under` `the notice` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the notice`'s `the termination date it states`
    WHEN JUST `the stated date` THEN `the stated date`
    WHEN NOTHING                THEN `the notice`'s `date of the notice`

§§ `The standing of the contract on a date`

-- What Articles 2 and 3 together say about one date, for one claimant. The arms are read in
-- order: the period, then the premium (2.2, 2.3, 3.1), then a notice (3.2.1), then a
-- transfer (2.4).
DECLARE `The standing of the contract on a date` IS ONE OF
    `in effect`
    `outside the period of insurance (2.1)`
    `not in effect, the premium not having been paid (2.2)`
    `ended for non-payment of the premium (2.3, 3.1.1)`
    `ended by a notice of unilateral termination (3.2.1)`
    `ended for the former owner when the vehicle was transferred (2.4)`
    `ended at the former owner's request when the vehicle was transferred (2.4)`
    `not in effect for a new owner before a transfer (2.4)`

@ref Rules, Articles 2.2-2.3 and 3.1.1, 3.1.3 (src 120-125, 137-141, 149-151)
GIVEN `the date`         IS A DATE
      `the arrangements` IS A `The premium arrangements`
GIVETH A `The standing of the contract on a date`
`the standing on` `the date` `as to the premium under` `the arrangements` MEANS
    CONSIDER `3.1.1 — the date the contract ends for non-payment under` `the arrangements`
    WHEN JUST `the end` THEN
        IF   `the date` AT LEAST `the end`
        THEN IF   `3.1.3 — the contract has been continued by the date` `the date` `under` `the arrangements`
             THEN `in effect`
             ELSE `ended for non-payment of the premium (2.3, 3.1.1)`
        ELSE `the 2.2 answer`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the 2.2 answer`
    WHERE
        `the 2.2 answer` MEANS
            IF   `2.2 — the premium condition is met on` `the date` `under` `the arrangements`
            THEN `in effect`
            ELSE `not in effect, the premium not having been paid (2.2)`

@ref Rules, Article 2.4 (src 126-129)
GIVEN `the date`     IS A DATE
      `the claimant` IS A `The claimant`
      `the policy`   IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A `The standing of the contract on a date`
`2.4 — the standing on` `the date` `for` `the claimant` `as to ownership under` `the policy` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the policy`'s `a transfer of ownership`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `before any transfer`
    WHEN JUST `the transfer` THEN
        IF   `the date` LESS THAN `the transfer`'s `date of the transfer`
        THEN `before any transfer`
        ELSE IF   `the transfer`'s `the former owner asked to end the contract`
             THEN `ended at the former owner's request when the vehicle was transferred (2.4)`
             ELSE CONSIDER `the claimant`
                  WHEN `the insured named on the certificate`             THEN `ended for the former owner when the vehicle was transferred (2.4)`
                  WHEN `a new owner to whom the vehicle was transferred`  THEN `in effect`
    WHERE
        `before any transfer` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the claimant`
            WHEN `the insured named on the certificate`             THEN `in effect`
            WHEN `a new owner to whom the vehicle was transferred`  THEN `not in effect for a new owner before a transfer (2.4)`

@ref Rules, Articles 2 and 3 (src 117-174)
GIVEN `the date`     IS A DATE
      `the claimant` IS A `The claimant`
      `the policy`   IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A `The standing of the contract on a date`
`the standing of the contract on` `the date` `for` `the claimant` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `2.1 — within the period of insurance` `the date` `under` `the policy`
            THEN `outside the period of insurance (2.1)`
        IF NOT (`the premium standing` EQUALS `in effect`)
            THEN `the premium standing`
        IF `ended by a notice on or before the date`
            THEN `ended by a notice of unilateral termination (3.2.1)`
        OTHERWISE `2.4 — the standing on` `the date` `for` `the claimant` `as to ownership under` `the policy`
    WHERE
        `the premium standing` MEANS
            `the standing on` `the date` `as to the premium under` (`the policy`'s `the premium arrangements`)
        `ended by a notice on or before the date` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the policy`'s `a notice of unilateral termination`
            WHEN NOTHING          THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST `the notice` THEN `3.2.1 — the date the contract ends under` `the notice` AT MOST `the date`

§§ `3.1.2 — the premium on an end for non-payment`

-- src:142 | 3.1.2 Bên mua bảo hiểm phải có nghĩa vụ thanh toán đầy đủ Phí bảo hiểm theo thỏa
-- src:143 | thuận tại Hợp đồng bảo hiểm. Trong thời hạn năm (05) ngày kể từ ngày Hợp
-- src:144 | đồng bảo hiểm chấm dứt hiệu lực, BẢO VIỆT sẽ hoàn lại cho Bên mua bảo
-- src:145 | hiểm phần Phí bảo hiểm đã đóng thừa (nếu có) hoặc yêu cầu Bên mua bảo hiểm
-- src:146 | thanh toán đầy đủ Phí bảo hiểm từ thời điểm bắt đầu hiệu lực bảo hiểm đến thời
-- src:147 | điểm chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo hiểm. BẢO VIỆT không hoàn phí bảo hiểm
-- src:148 | trong trường hợp đã phát sinh trách nhiệm bồi thường.
-- Within 5 days of the end the insurer refunds any premium paid beyond what the period up
-- to the end earned, or asks for the premium for that period; it refunds nothing once
-- liability to pay compensation has arisen. The premium for a part of the period is taken
-- pro rata by calendar days (fork F9).
@ref Rules, Article 3.1.2 (src 142-148)
GIVEN `the end`    IS A DATE
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.1.2 — the premium for the period up to` `the end` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    `the policy`'s `the premium arrangements`'s `the premium` TIMES (1 MINUS `the share of the period of insurance remaining from` `the end` `under` `the policy`)

@ref Rules, Article 3.1.2 (src 142-148)
GIVEN `the end`                                       IS A DATE
      `the policy`                                    IS A `The policy`
      `liability to pay compensation has arisen`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.1.2 — the premium to refund on an end on` `the end` `under` `the policy` `, liability having arisen:` `liability to pay compensation has arisen` MEANS
    IF   `liability to pay compensation has arisen`
    THEN 0
    ELSE max 0 (`the policy`'s `the premium arrangements`'s `the premium paid so far` MINUS `3.1.2 — the premium for the period up to` `the end` `under` `the policy`)

@ref Rules, Article 3.1.2 (src 142-148)
GIVEN `the end`    IS A DATE
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.1.2 — the premium the insurer asks for on an end on` `the end` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    max 0 (`3.1.2 — the premium for the period up to` `the end` `under` `the policy` MINUS `the policy`'s `the premium arrangements`'s `the premium paid so far`)

@ref Rules, Article 3.1.2 (src 143-147)
GIVEN `the end` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`3.1.2 — the last day for the insurer to refund or ask for the premium` `the end` MEANS
    `the day` 5 `days after` `the end`

@ref Rules, Article 3.1.2 (src 143-147); clock in days from the end of the contract
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`3.1.2 — the insurer settles the premium within 5 days of the end` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MUST  `refund the overpaid premium, or ask for the unpaid premium`
    WITHIN 5
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurer` BECAUSE "3.1.2: the premium was not refunded or asked for within 5 days of the end of the contract"

§§ `3.2.2 and 3.2.3 — the purchaser ends the contract`

-- src:159 | 3.2.2 Trường hợp Bên mua bảo hiểm chấm dứt Hợp đồng bảo hiểm trước hạn phải
-- src:160 | thông báo bằng văn bản cho BẢO VIỆT. Trong thời hạn mười lăm (15) ngày kể
-- src:161 | từ ngày nhận được thông báo bằng văn bản của Bên mua bảo hiểm, BẢO VIỆT
-- src:162 | phải hoàn lại cho Bên mua bảo hiểm bảy mươi phần trăm (70%) Phí bảo hiểm
-- src:163 | tương ứng với thời gian còn lại của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm. BẢO VIỆT không
-- src:164 | phải hoàn phí bảo hiểm trong trường hợp đã xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm và phát
-- src:165 | sinh trách nhiệm bồi thường bảo hiểm trước khi Hợp đồng bảo hiểm bị chấm
-- src:166 | dứt.
-- The insurer refunds 70% of the premium for the rest of the period within 15 days of
-- receiving the purchaser's written notice, and nothing where an insured event has happened
-- and liability has arisen before the end.
@ref Rules, Article 3.2.2 (src 159-166)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.2.2 — the share of the premium refunded when the purchaser ends the contract` MEANS 70%

@ref Rules, Article 3.2.2 (src 159-166)
GIVEN `the premium`                               IS A NUMBER
      `the end`                                   IS A DATE
      `the policy`                                IS A `The policy`
      `liability to pay compensation has arisen`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.2.2 — the refund of` `the premium` `when the purchaser ends the contract on` `the end` `under` `the policy` `, liability having arisen:` `liability to pay compensation has arisen` MEANS
    IF   `liability to pay compensation has arisen`
    THEN 0
    ELSE `3.2.2 — the share of the premium refunded when the purchaser ends the contract`
         TIMES `the premium`
         TIMES `the share of the period of insurance remaining from` `the end` `under` `the policy`

@ref Rules, Article 3.2.2 (src 160-163)
GIVEN `the date the insurer received the notice` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`3.2.2 — the last day for the refund to the purchaser` `the date the insurer received the notice` MEANS
    `the day` 15 `days after` `the date the insurer received the notice`

-- src:167 | 3.2.3 Đối với Hợp đồng bảo hiểm cho nhóm xe, việc hoàn phí được xem xét theo
-- src:168 | từng xe: trường hợp xe thuộc hợp đồng nhóm chưa phát sinh trách nhiệm bồi
-- src:169 | thường thì được áp dụng hoàn phí theo tỷ lệ quy định tại điểm 3.2.2 trên đây.
-- Vehicle by vehicle: a vehicle with no liability arisen gets the 3.2.2 refund on its own
-- premium.
@ref Rules, Article 3.2.3 (src 167-169)
GIVEN `the end`      IS A DATE
      `the policy`   IS A `The policy`
      `the vehicles` IS A LIST OF `A vehicle under a group contract`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`3.2.3 — the refund on a group contract ended by the purchaser on` `the end` `under` `the policy` `for` `the vehicles` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN v YIELD `3.2.2 — the refund of` (v's `its premium`) `when the purchaser ends the contract on` `the end` `under` `the policy` `, liability having arisen:` (v's `liability to compensate has arisen for it`))
             `the vehicles`)

@ref Rules, Article 3.2.2 (src 160-163); clock in days from the insurer's receipt of the notice
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`3.2.2 — the insurer refunds within 15 days of receiving the purchaser's notice` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MUST  `refund the premium for the rest of the period`
    WITHIN 15
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurer` BECAUSE "3.2.2: the 70% refund was not made within 15 days of receiving the purchaser's notice"

§§ `3.2.4 — the insurer ends the contract`

